OL,3,ASupreme Court allows Trump to use
OL,4,Acontroversial database to check voter
OL,5,Acitizenship
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Supreme Court has lifted
OL,8,Frestrictions on the Trump
OL,9,Fadministration to use a controversial
OL,10,Ffederal database that uses citizenship
OL,11,Finformation and other sensitive data to
OL,12,Fidentify voters suspected of being
OL,13,Fnon-citizens.
OL,15,FCritics have questioned the reliability
OL,16,Fof the data, warning it could result in
OL,17,FUS citizens being wrongly removed from
OL,18,Felectoral rolls.
OL,20,FIn June, a federal judge ruled that the
OL,21,Fsystem was illegal and violated the
OL,22,Fprivacy rights of Americans.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
